1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:01,605
M: Do we still have far to go?

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:04,290
This carry-on bag is really hurting my shoulder.

3
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:05,760
W: We're almost there.

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,125
The gate is just up those stairs there.

5
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:10,390
What do you have in your bag anyway?

6
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,805
M: Oh, I picked up some CDs and toys for my kids.

7
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:16,155
The prices are unbelievably cheap here.

8
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:18,970
W: This must be your first trip here.

9
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:22,250
I remember picking up things when I first came here.

10
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:26,540
After a while, you forget that everything here is cheaper than things back home.
